	(text "RTC backup: BT3 = ML1220 RECHARGEABLE only (trickled from 3.3v via R75+D7 ~= 3.0 V).\nIf fitting a CR1220 primary cell instead: DNP R75 and D7.\nD6: power button also pulls BQ25798 ~QON low - hold >15 s with adapter absent = ship mode exit/entry."
