	(text "AUDIO + DOCK MCU\nU29 PAM8406: stereo class-D amp fed from the upper display's 3.5mm HDMI-audio jack\n  via J22 pigtail (tip=L ring=R sleeve=GND). MODE=+5v -> Class-D. 1uF input caps.\n  ~MUTE/~SHDN pulled to +5v via 100K; RP2350B may pull low OPEN-DRAIN ONLY (5V net).\n  BTL outputs: no caps, no ground on OUT-. J20/J21 pins 1-2=+, 3-4=-.\n  NOTE: volume is the HDMI/display path volume; keep aux wiring away from hinge RF.\nU28 Core2350B (RP2350B): GP0/1/2 = PD controller I2C+IRQ, GP6/7 = BQ25798 I2C,\n  GP10 = PWR_BUT, GP11 = nRPIBOOT (drive low -> CM5 USB boot). Powered from +5v via\n  onboard LDO. RP_3V3 is module 3.3V OUTPUT - do not back-feed.\n  DSI86_EN: CM5 GPIO26 enables the DSI-DP bridge (devicetree enable-gpios)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e0c0a315-8f04-4f88-8def-4b5b6bb1abcd")
	)
